From 7773b3ae2ceb1345953becf53d9ccfe96cd7b52d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Corin McHargue <corin.mchargue@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 16:05:38 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] feat(worktree): allow an external provider command to manage
 worktrees

Add worktrees.provider_command and TUIOS_WORKTREES_PROVIDER_COMMAND.
When set (or when HERDR_WORKTREES_PROVIDER_COMMAND is in the environment),
tuios delegates worktree creation, listing, and removal to the external
provider through the JSON-RPC contract (detect, resolve, create, list,
remove).

Repositories not claimed by the provider fall back to native git worktrees.
